 Returns `204 No Content` on success.
 
+## Publishing boards
+
+Publishing a board creates a secret, public URL that anyone can open — no account or sign in needed. That URL is returned in the `public_url` field of the board, which is `null` while the board isn't published.
+
+A published board can be browsed at:
+
+| URL | Description |
+|-----|-------------|
+| `GET /:account_slug/public/boards/:public_key` | The board, with its columns and their cards |
+| `GET /:account_slug/public/boards/:public_key/columns/:column_id` | A single column, with all of its cards |
+| `GET /:account_slug/public/boards/:public_key/cards/:card_number` | A single published card |
+
+### `POST /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Publishes a board. Only board administrators can publish a board. Publishing a board that's already published keeps its current public URL.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `201 Created` with the board in the same shape as `GET /:account_slug/boards/:board_id`:
+
+```json
+{
+  "id": "03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+  "name": "Fizzy",
+  "all_access": true,
+  "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.534Z",
+  "auto_postpone_period_in_days": 30,
+  "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/boards/03f5v9zkft4hj9qq0lsn9ohcm",
+  "public_url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/public/boards/4Xx2uVHKrDpbUFpJfNSbcDKu",
+  "creator": {
+    "id": "03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7",
+    "name": "David Heinemeier Hansson",
+    "role": "owner",
+    "active": true,
+    "email_address": "david@example.com",
+    "created_at": "2025-12-05T19:36:35.401Z",
+    "url": "http://app.fizzy.localhost:3006/897362094/users/03f5v9zjw7pz8717a4no1h8a7"
+  }
+}
+```
+
+### `DELETE /:account_slug/boards/:board_id/publication`
+
+Unpublishes a board. Only board administrators can unpublish a board. The public URL stops working right away, and publishing the board again generates a new one.
+
+__Response:__
+
+Returns `204 No Content` on success.
+
 ## Board Accesses
 
 Board accesses let you see who has access to a board and their involvement level (watching or access only). Any board member can view this information.
